<title>USA: Interchange Financial in 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Interchange Financial in 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SADDLE BROOK, N.J. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interchange Financial Services Corp said Monday it has declared a three-for-two stock split, payable April 17, to shareholders of record March 20.</p>
<p>The company also said it increased its quarterly cash dividend to $0.2025, from $0.1850, with the same payable and record dates.</p>
<p>The dividend after considering the effects of the stock split, said the company, will be $0.135 cents per share, quarterly.</p>
